{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing the image encoder from resnet50 to imagenet_vit_l in a multimodal setup with scvi_n200 RNA, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.725 (vs 0.713 in config_007) and F1 of 0.685 suggest potential performance benefits from the more complex imagenet_vit_l encoder. However, the relative impact of the image encoder choice versus other components remains uncertain due to limited direct comparisons and potential interactions with aggregation/fusion strategies."
}

